{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雪中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拈起火把云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "育王秀嵓會中，時佛照居東庵。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一人四明，一人處州。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以\n火把打圓相云："}
